Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：带来最强运气的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有 No.7的查理{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.53,0:00:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 场地失去了控制{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是暴走中的单轨列车。 唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.11,0:00:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去我们就要！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真由美酱差不多该做手术了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真由美）嗯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.57,0:00:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你睡着的时候马上就会结束的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。 但是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叔叔他 还没…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（查理）来吧游马
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我们开始我们的狂欢吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.09,0:00:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 上了！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放1张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.19,0:00:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）他 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只靠运气就想赢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.39,0:01:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.09,0:01:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续魔法 拜拜游戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先 来试试运气吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡一回合一次 掷骰子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果掷出6我现在的生命值 就会变成5倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 如果掷出其他点数
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值 就会回到发动时的数值！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！6点哪有可能那么容易掷出来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 他从刚才那场决斗开始{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经连续5次掷出6了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.70,0:01:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次也是6的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个概率是 四万六千六百五十六分之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.25,0:01:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我好好看着。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对 掷不出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看招！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.84,0:01:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咯……6？又出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.87,0:01:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4000的生命值变成了5倍的两万！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.09,0:01:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除非太阳被劈成两半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.95,0:01:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}否则我的运气 是不会停的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.31,0:02:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少罗嗦！太阳早就已经落山了好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 已经没有什么能阻止我的运气了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要召唤雄伟小丑！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.95,0:02:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用雄伟小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.43,0:02:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击里侧守备怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用攻击力 零的怪兽来攻击！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（查理）死亡哑剧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.61,0:02:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆石人的守备力是 1500！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到伤害的是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.98,0:02:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}庄严小丑的效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是 骰子？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用不完的运气我就哗哗地使出来啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}庄严小丑进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掷出6的话就破坏对方怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.63,0:02:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掷出其他点数的话这家伙就会被破坏 说拜拜了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 连续掷出6的概率是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.89,0:02:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}二十七万九千九百三十六分之一！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎…… 怎么可能掷得出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:03:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 嘿呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然有这种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中大奖！ 我 破坏隆隆魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.23,0:03:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀啊——！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.21,0:03:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去 我们……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别担心！不管怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.29,0:03:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们可是有世界第一的护身符啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.37,0:05:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《明里：查理 查理！》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《从那之后到现在一直杳无音信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道跑哪儿去了……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个笨蛋！》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.02,0:05:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今 我也靠运气来决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 怪兽槽！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将我场上的 等级4的我我我魔术师与{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同等级的怪兽 从墓地除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 从卡组抽卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那张卡 与那2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是相同等级4的怪兽的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:05:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就特殊召唤到场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 如果是除此之外的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就必须将抽到的卡 与选择的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太蠢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少罗嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要抽中等级4的超量素材就凑齐了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还不明白啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.51,0:06:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份运气也已经被我吸走变得空空如也了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！拜托了，我的运气。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.57,0:06:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！？怎么会这样～。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈，我说过了吧靠运气是赢不了我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的他，我们能赢的概率
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.99,0:06:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或许是百分之零。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你也说这种话！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我手中的卡所带来的运气绝对没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你父亲 一马先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.65,0:06:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说 一直是憧憬的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个人 是拥有一切的人我一直这么认为。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 唯独有一样他没有拥有的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 运气。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.85,0:07:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要有一点点运气的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}运气什么的 跟这没关系！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人啊 在关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有绝对不能输的胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 就算依靠运气也好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.31,0:07:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也必须赢着回来才行啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.18,0:07:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 我的回合！ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续魔法 拜拜游戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中一个奖 生命值就5倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！别再出了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.53,0:07:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又……又来了～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.32,0:07:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出到6了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值狂欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然生命值有10万点！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}10万……这种生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要怎么打倒啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 释放·交换！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将我场上的1只怪兽释放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只相同等级的怪兽特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级1的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}威严小丑释放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将相同等级的 骰子槽·七特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（骰子槽·七）掷骰！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 怪兽槽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然 和我一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.17,0:08:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是我来用的话，会怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择等级1的骰子机·七！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将同为等级1的威严小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，如果抽到的卡是等级1的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.90,0:08:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就把那只怪兽特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞，来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.11,0:08:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤骰子机·七！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把第3张骰子机·七通常召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:09:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掷骰！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骰子机·七
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掷出骰子，直到结束阶段{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照掷出的点数提升等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.60,0:09:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 6的豹子！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 三个都是6的概率是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3亿6，279万。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.39,0:09:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～！ 已经不想听了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.14,0:09:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哈… 居然会这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的中了呢…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只骰子七的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从1变成7。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用3只等级7的骰子七
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骰 骰 骰骰 骰～子！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.81,0:09:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.7幸运条纹！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（幸运条纹）幸运七！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}数字！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.65,0:10:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了来了　来了来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命　就是　狂欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除非太阳被劈成两半否则{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵…　我的运气是不会用完的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）小鸟酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）明里小姐！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了？　冷静下来听我说。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那辆单轨电车　还有5分钟就要到终点站了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎　那岂不是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.21,0:10:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会想办法解决的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马上就要到终点站了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动幸运条纹的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗1个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:10:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掷骰子。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 幸运条纹的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到战斗结束为止{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会变成其原本攻击力乘以掷出的点数所得出的数值！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.98,0:11:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是6！幸运条纹的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原本攻击力是 700。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其乘以 6。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.21,0:11:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 攻击力是 4200！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4200！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用幸运条纹 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超级幸运·新星！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.47,0:11:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动！ 奇策！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在被直接攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌中的怪兽卡1张 送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽的攻击力数值
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的战斗伤害降低！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地的是刷拉拉骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:12:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值下降。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还挺有一套的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶。 喂有没有什么好办法啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果他的运气是完美的话已经无计可施了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.81,0:12:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）喂 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛这么消沉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.91,0:12:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明里……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}查理 你给我在那等着！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我现在就去 狠狠揍你一顿！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是这么火爆啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是亲亲的话我倒很乐意让你来哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.03,0:12:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你被查理偷走的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是被幸运条纹给干掉了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.77,0:12:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）那张卡上有个传说。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.29,0:12:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“当太阳一分为二之时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.63,0:12:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其力化风 飘然逝去”。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？ 那是什么鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得 卡片的运气据说是会失去言语的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去运气……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我不是一直说了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命就是狂欢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要太阳不裂成两半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的运气就永远不会耗尽。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把太阳劈成两半……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为如此这张卡的运气是绝对的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.90,0:13:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经没时间了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，游马。差不多够了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这里投降吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我，我绝对不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤努力骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4的怪兽召唤成功的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌把影蜥蜴可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.18,0:13:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（影蜥蜴）影 影影。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.03,0:13:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 等级４的坚忍骑士和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影蜥蜴叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.99,0:13:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.３９！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.91,0:13:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:14:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望皇霍普攻击幸运条纹人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 骰子危机！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 掷骰子掷出的点数为６时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把攻击力变成零
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得对方１只怪兽的控制权。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.53,0:14:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对出不来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求你了 别出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.29,0:14:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不凑巧啊 又是这样又掷出６了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来霍普就是我的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.11,0:14:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多快到终点站了让这场决斗结束吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.69,0:14:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是赢不了的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我的运气面前你已经无计可施了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}运气 运气什么的我最看不惯了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.77,0:14:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管有没有运气{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.12,0:14:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都要使出全部力量去战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:14:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 没错是老爸教给我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.85,0:15:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸他才没有依赖什么运气！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}靠自己的力量不管什么都是自己开辟出来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我也！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了 既然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就由我来结束掉 我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.07,0:15:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.95,0:15:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 打开！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剑之采配！ 当场上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有光属性战士族怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以在对方的抽卡阶段发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那张卡是魔法或陷阱的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.35,0:15:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要么破坏抽到的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要么将你场上的魔法 陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗 你的目标是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.69,0:15:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏骰子危机{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把霍普夺回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽牌吧，查理！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.59,0:16:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的卡是太阳的天秤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡1回合1次掷骰子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.17,0:16:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掷出6的话，就能把对方场地上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.95,0:16:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你把霍普变回原样我的胜利也不会改变！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除非太阳被劈成两半。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太阳！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把骰子危机…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，是太阳！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}斩开太阳！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太阳？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把太阳劈成两半…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.91,0:16:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此，难道说！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道要用决斗做到那种事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.47,0:16:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭借剑之采配的效果被选中的剑士霍普啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡太阳的天秤将那太阳斩裂吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不、不会吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.39,0:17:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太阳……太阳变成两个了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 等等 真的是靠运气？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那道光是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说卡的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能有这种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于太阳的天秤被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.13,0:17:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要承受５００点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的运气怎么可能消失！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.87,0:17:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动拜拜游戏的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掷骰子如果出６生命值就变成５倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果不行 就回到原本的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.03,0:17:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回到生命值！ 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.86,0:17:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１！？ 哎～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:18:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的运气已经没了吗回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.47,0:18:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 就是现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.85,0:18:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 回归！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手场上的我的怪兽呼唤回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.62,0:18:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回来吧 我的希望！ 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧～ 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.71,0:18:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌 超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.90,0:18:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是 现身之时。 CNo.３９！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望之力将混沌变为光的使者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用１个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.77,0:18:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力提升５００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.31,0:18:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，每有１个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击力就下降１０００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击幸运条纹！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.80,0:19:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑·混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶，赢了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.09,0:19:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.35,0:19:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}车站要！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～赶不上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.03,0:20:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们两个都没事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.09,0:20:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了，查理呢！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.11,0:20:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的运气……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.81,0:20:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的运气消失了……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起……真由美……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）谁啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.04,0:20:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……明里！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.72,0:20:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个叫真由美的女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（查理）真由美～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真由美）大叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉啊，来晚了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是咒语。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天，真由美。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，加油。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真由美）嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 另一件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.15,0:20:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 就当是护身符吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.87,0:20:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:20:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会一飞冲天地努力的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定因为换了主人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}运气就回来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手术一定会 成功的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那孩子的手术 好像很难…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我才把运气…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.12,0:21:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡想交给她…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}查理。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这样 也不能做那种事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.44,0:21:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明里。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帮我转告游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马先生的 一飞冲天精神{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.41,0:21:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你继承得很出色啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.28,0:21:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.80,0:21:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了啊 明里…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.17,0:21:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（扇耳光的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见啦…。下次见面的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化个像样点的妆吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.63,0:21:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么总之 今天就算结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.49,0:21:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 肚子都饿了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的会把 No.卡还回来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.38,0:22:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该没问题吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.23,0:22:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 果然还是应该再多叮嘱几句才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 游马！

